(The Time Traveller \(for so it will be convenient to speak of him\)) Tj
T*
(was expounding a recondite matter to us. His grey eyes shone and) Tj
T*
(twinkled, and his usually pale face was flushed and animated. The) Tj
T*
(fire burnt brightly, and the soft radiance of the incandescent) Tj
T*
(lights in the lilies of silver caught the bubbles that flashed and) Tj
T*
(passed in our glasses. Our chairs, being his patents, embraced and) Tj
T*
(caressed us rather than submitted to be sat upon, and there was that) Tj
T*
(luxurious after-dinner atmosphere, when thought runs gracefully free) Tj
T*
(of the trammels of precision. And he put it to us in this way-marking) Tj
T*
